{
  "sn47.43:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 47.43 ",
  "sn47.43:0.2": "5. Amatavagga ",
  "sn47.43:0.3": "Maggasutta ",
  "sn47.43:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn47.43:1.2": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "sn47.43:1.3": "“ekamidāhaṁ, bhikkhave, samayaṁ uruvelāyaṁ viharāmi najjā nerañjarāya tīre ajapālanigrodhe paṭhamābhisambuddho. ",
  "sn47.43:1.4": "Tassa mayhaṁ, bhikkhave, rahogatassa paṭisallīnassa evaṁ cetaso parivitakko udapādi: ",
  "sn47.43:1.5": "‘ekāyanvāyaṁ maggo sattānaṁ visuddhiyā sokaparidevānaṁ samatikkamāya dukkhadomanassānaṁ atthaṅgamāya ñāyassa adhigamāya nibbānassa sacchikiriyāya, yadidaṁ—cattāro satipaṭṭhānā. ",
  "sn47.43:2.1": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "sn47.43:2.2": "Kāye vā bhikkhu kāyānupassī vihareyya ātāpī sampajāno satimā, vineyya loke abhijjhādomanassaṁ; ",
  "sn47.43:2.3": "vedanāsu vā bhikkhu vedanānupassī vihareyya …pe… ",
  "sn47.43:2.4": "citte vā bhikkhu cittānupassī vihareyya …pe… ",
  "sn47.43:2.5": "dhammesu vā bhikkhu dhammānupassī vihareyya ātāpī sampajāno satimā, vineyya loke abhijjhādomanassaṁ. ",
  "sn47.43:2.6": "Ekāyanvāyaṁ maggo sattānaṁ visuddhiyā sokaparidevānaṁ samatikkamāya dukkhadomanassānaṁ atthaṅgamāya ñāyassa adhigamāya nibbānassa sacchikiriyāya, yadidaṁ—cattāro satipaṭṭhānā’ti. ",
  "sn47.43:3.1": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, brahmā sahampati mama cetasā cetoparivitakkamaññāya—seyyathāpi nāma balavā puriso s